<BaseLayout title="Advertising & Ads | B Tecky" description="Advertising disclosure, Google AdSense information and ads.txt details for B Tecky.">
<main><section class="legal-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY & LEGAL / B TECKY</p><h1 class="display">Advertising & Ads</h1><p>How advertising may appear on B Tecky and where to find our publisher declaration.</p><small>Last updated: 1 November 2026</small></div></section><article class="container legal-content">
<section><h2>Advertising disclosure</h2><p>B Tecky may display advertisements served by Google AdSense or other advertising partners. Ads are clearly separate from editorial content, tools and recommendations. Advertising does not determine the results shown by the Arcade tools.</p></section>
<section><h2>Personalized advertising</h2><p>Google and its partners may use cookies or similar technologies for ad delivery, frequency capping, measurement and personalization, subject to your region and choices. Manage personalization at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>ads.txt</h2><p>B Tecky publishes an authorized digital sellers declaration at the website root. You can view it at <a href="/ads.txt">this site's root ads.txt endpoint</a>. This file identifies the Google publisher account authorized to sell advertising inventory for the site. It does not guarantee ad serving or AdSense approval.</p></section>
<section><h2>Questions</h2><p>For advertising or privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:lavishsheth122@gmail.com">lavishsheth122@gmail.com</a>.</p></section>
</article></main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.legal-hero{padding:76px 0 48px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f6ff,#fff)}.legal-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,4.8rem);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:15px 0}.legal-hero p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:700px;color:#667085;line-height:1.7}.legal-hero small{color:#667085}.legal-content{max-width:850px;padding-block:48px 90px}.legal-content section{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e9f0}.legal-content h2{font:800 1.35rem var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.03em}.legal-content p{color:#475467;line-height:1.8}.legal-content a{color:#315efb;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}</style>